 shing and Pedagogy (EUR 6\,000 bursary\, Fabrique POLA\, Bordeaux)
DESCRIPTION:EXTRA\, a Bordeaux association that publishes book-objects abou
 t space\, invites proposals for a residency to create a book-object at the
  crossroads of architecture\, publishing and pedagogy\, hosted at Fabrique
  POLA in Bordeaux. Residents spend four weeks of research and creation bet
 ween January and June 2027 and test the project with a public of their cho
 osing (for example early childhood\, school groups or older people). WHO: 
 artists\, architects\, landscape architects\, urban planners\, graphic des
 igners\, authors and other professionals interested in questions of space\
 ; individual\, duo or collective applications\; no age limit and no stated
  geographic restriction\, though the call is in French. The project must b
 e unpublished and not already under a publishing contract\, and applicants
  must be able to step away from other work during the residency periods. W
 HAT YOU GET: a EUR 6\,000 bursary in three instalments (one bursary per pr
 oject\, even for collectives)\, up to EUR 500 for materials and up to EUR 
 1\,000 for travel on receipts (sustainable transport preferred)\, accommod
 ation for up to two people\, a workspace at Fabrique POLA\, support from E
 XTRA for the research and public experiments\, a presentation at the venue
 \, and possible publication of the book-object under a separate contract w
 ith EXTRA. APPLICATION: free\; see the call page for conditions\, criteria
  and application guidance\, or contact extra.editeurdespaces@gmail.com. DE
 ADLINE: 9 November 2026.\n\nOrganisation: EXTRA (Editeur d'espaces)\, host
 ed at Fabrique POLA\nLocation: Fabrique POLA\, Bordeaux\, France. No geogr
 aphic restriction stated\; the call is published in French.\nAward: EUR 6\
 ,000 bursary (paid in three instalments\; not multiplied for duos or colle
 ctives)\, up to EUR 500 for materials and up to EUR 1\,000 for travel on r
 eceipts\, accommodation covered. No application fee.\nDuration: 4 weeks of
  research and creation between January and June 2027.\n\nMore: https://www
 .alternatif-art.com/appel-a-candidature/residence-extra-2027-livre-objet-a
 rchitecture-et-pedagogie/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium
